00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:50.030
integration.

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:53.373
So you can see how your
integration is doing.

00:12:53.373 --> 00:12:55.540
So for example, you can see
whether the total number

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:57.250
of products looks correct.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:59.440
Whether the right number
of products is in stock.

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:02.380
Sometimes people accidentally
