00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:05.920
and then forget to turn it back
in stock, so we put this here.

00:13:05.920 --> 00:13:09.370
You can make sure that your
product catalog is up to date.

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:12.220
And you can also check the
status of your user event

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:13.130
integration.

00:13:13.130 --> 00:13:15.625
So we've actually come across
situations where even one

00:13:15.625 --> 00:13:17.500
