00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:26.643
So you would see
stuff like that,

00:13:26.643 --> 00:13:28.060
where there's a
massive user event

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:30.520
drop here from this dashboard.

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:32.260
And a common problem
